<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1311347602"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1551586021"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="リセット"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="向井太一"/><amll:meta key="album" value="リセット"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:09.845"><div begin="00:08.213" end="03:51.015"><p begin="00:08.213" end="00:13.945" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">走り出せれば、ほら、掴めるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踏出脚步 近在眼前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha shi ri da se re ba ho ra tsu ka me ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:14.221" end="00:18.586" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">一度離した明日へのチケット<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再错过 明日希望</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi do ha na shi ta a shi ta he no chi ke 't to</span></p><p begin="00:18.653" end="00:23.346" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">この場所から始まるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切始于此地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ba sho ka ra ha ji ma ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:23.768" end="00:28.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">取り戻すため、もう一度リセット<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寻找自我 再度出发</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ri mo do su ta me mo u i chi do ri se 't to</span></p><p begin="00:28.017" end="00:32.205" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">改札を出て眼に映るサンセット<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">车站之外 遍洒夕阳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka i sa tsu wo de te me ni u tsu ru sa n se 't to</span></p><p begin="00:32.777" end="00:37.603" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">オレンジ色が滲んで見えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">灿金光华 映照脸庞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o re n ji i ro ga ni ji n de mi e te</span></p><p begin="00:37.603" end="00:41.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">流す涙を静かに照らして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眼眶湿润 轻泛泪光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ga su na mi da wo shi zu ka ni te ra shi te</span></p><p begin="00:42.336" end="00:46.992" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">帰る場所だって言ってる気がして Eh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恍如指引 走向归处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka e ru ba sho da 't te i 't te ru ki ga shi te</span></p><p begin="00:47.766" end="00:51.515" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">並んで歩くほどに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">何必执着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ra n de a ru ku ho do ni</span></p><p begin="00:52.529" end="00:56.182" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">人と比べてばかり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">处处与人较量</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to to ku ra be te ba ka ri</span></p><p begin="00:57.350" end="01:01.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">いつの間にか背伸びして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终将发觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu no ma ni ka se no bi shi te</span></p><p begin="01:01.743" end="01:05.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">強がる自分に気づく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过偏爱逞强</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo ga ru ji bu n ni ki zu ku</span></p><p begin="01:05.745" end="01:11.395" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">走り出せれば、ほら、掴めるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踏出脚步 近在眼前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha shi ri da se re ba ho ra tsu ka me ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:11.762" end="01:16.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">一度離した明日へのチケット<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再错过 明日希望</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi do ha na shi ta a shi ta he no chi ke 't to</span></p><p begin="01:16.286" end="01:20.985" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">この場所から始まるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切始于此地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ba sho ka ra ha ji ma ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:21.310" end="01:26.081" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">取り戻すため、もう一度リセット<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寻找自我 再度出发</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ri mo do su ta me mo u i chi do ri se 't to</span></p><p begin="01:35.161" end="01:39.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">過去に縛られ、課せを引きずって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些过往束缚着我前行的脚步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ko ni shi ba ra re ka se wo hi ki zu 't te</span></p><p begin="01:39.938" end="01:44.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">身動き取れなくなってしまった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐的一步也无法动弹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi u go ki to re na ku na 't te shi ma 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:44.810" end="01:49.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">消えて忘れてしまいたいなんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘴上喊着想要消失想要忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e te wa su re te shi ma i ta i na n te</span></p><p begin="01:49.549" end="01:54.186" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">被害者ぶって逃げていただけ Eh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过是把自己伪装成了受害者 选择了逃避</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ga i sha bu 't te ni ge te i ta da ke</span></p><p begin="01:54.956" end="01:58.818" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">いつもよりぬるい風呂<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在比平时稍凉一些的洗澡水中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo yo ri nu ru i fu ro no na ka de</span></p><p begin="01:59.717" end="02:03.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">の中で自問自答<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji mo n ji to u</span></p><p begin="02:04.508" end="02:08.421" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">悩んでいたことなんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才发现 我所烦恼的事情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ya n de i ta ko to na n te</span></p><p begin="02:09.061" end="02:13.693" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">チッポケなことだったんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都不过是沧海一粟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi 'p po ke na ko to da 't ta n da</span></p><p begin="02:13.023" end="02:16.061" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">くじけそうな時は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是遇到了挫折 那就停下脚步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ji ke so u na to ki wa ta chi do ma 't te</span></p><p begin="02:16.293" end="02:20.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">立ち止まって見つめ直して</p><p begin="02:21.009" end="02:23.361" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">自分らしさへ</p><p begin="02:23.371" end="02:28.227" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">諦めない心を掴め<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坚定永不言弃的初心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ki ra me na i ko ko ro wo tsu ka me</span></p><p begin="02:28.566" end="02:33.181" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">また最初から、もう一度リセット<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从零开始 再度出发</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta sa i sho ka ra mo u i chi do ri se 't to</span></p><p begin="02:34.191" end="02:38.914" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">色んなことを大げさにして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实很多事情 我都过于小题大做了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ro n na ko to wo o o ge sa ni shi te</span></p><p begin="02:39.093" end="02:43.628" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">優しい心無くし傷付け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">遗失了从前那颗善良的心 伤害了他人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi i ko ko ro na ku shi ki zu tsu ke</span></p><p begin="02:43.790" end="02:48.424" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">自分が一番可愛くなって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是想要护己周全</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n ga i chi ba n ka wa i ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="02:48.645" end="02:53.458" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">気づけば今は一人ぽっちで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到头来却发现身边早就空无一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu ke ba i ma wa hi to ri po 'c chi de</span></p><p begin="02:54.853" end="02:57.763" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">また明日から<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望从明天起 可以与人相视而笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta a shi ta ka ra wa ra i a e ru yo u</span></p><p begin="02:59.671" end="03:02.691" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">笑い合えるよう</p><p begin="03:04.433" end="03:07.329" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">まずはここから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望一切改变 始于此地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma zu wa ko ko ka ra ka e ra re ru yo u</span></p><p begin="03:09.380" end="03:11.458" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">変えられるよ</p><p begin="03:10.525" end="03:16.317" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">走り出せれば、ほら、掴めるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踏出脚步 近在眼前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha shi ri da se re ba ho ra tsu ka me ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:16.629" end="03:20.965" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">一度離した明日へのチケット<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再错过 明日希望</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi do ha na shi ta a shi ta he no chi ke 't to</span></p><p begin="03:21.066" end="03:25.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">この場所から始まるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切始于此地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ba sho ka ra ha ji ma ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:26.139" end="03:30.888" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">取り戻すため、もう一度リセット<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寻找自我 再度出发</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ri mo do su ta me mo u i chi do ri se 't to</span></p><p begin="03:29.953" end="03:34.237" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">広がる世界はボクだけのものさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的世界 天大地大</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ro ga ru se ka i wa bo ku da ke no mo no sa</span></p><p begin="03:34.642" end="03:39.072" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">もう一度取り戻すリセット<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再度出发 找回昔日光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u i chi do to ri mo do su ri se 't to</span></p><p begin="03:39.429" end="03:43.872" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">生み出す力がボクを満たすから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前进的动力令我重新振作</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu mi da su chi ka ra ga bo ku wo mi ta su ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:44.275" end="03:48.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">もう一度走り出すスタート<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再度出发 生命由此启航</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u i chi do ha shi ri da su su ta a to</span></p><p begin="03:48.937" end="03:51.015" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">Oh, no, no, yeah</p></div></body></tt>